1. Cartridge Hardware (critical)

The device holds 12 scent slots split into two physical halves:
- LEFT half: slots 1–6
- RIGHT half: slots 7–12

Each half holds one cartridge set. The food palette occupies both halves by default. A separate abstract/floral perfume cartridge (6 scents) can replace EITHER the left OR the right half—not both at once.

If cartridge state lists disabled_sets, those cartridge halves are unavailable—do not compose with their scents and do not suggest swapping them in.

